.avif?t=1741712388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847970/extras/2402d2df1f5683f39654bae732ab17fb.webm?t=1741712388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847970/extras/2402d2df1f5683f39654bae732ab17fb.mp4?t=1741712388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thoroughly developed plot<br></li><li>Five atmospheric, detailed locations<br></li><li>First-person narration<br></li><li>Puzzles and riddles<br></li><li>Frightening moments<br></li><li>Gloomy atmosphere<br></li><li>Slavic mythology setting</li></ul>",
